Wutopia Lab viene despuntando en los últimos años con interiores tan cosmopolitas como brillantes. The Aluminium Mountain, su último trabajo, es un parque expositivo dedicado a las medicinas ancestrales chinas en Cantón. En roomdiseno.com te lo contamos y mostramos.

•••

@wutopialab_sh #wutopialab #wutopialabdesign #chinesearchitecture #chineseinteriordesign #metalbuilding #metalbuildings #arquitectochino #arquitecturachina #contemporarychinesearchitecture #roomdiseno #roomdiseño

PRODUCTION*Density / Ecological Urbanism (Taillandier Paris)Curator : @_mateo_btn_ Master 1 ENSA Versailles
@ensa_versailles According to Line+, architecture is not just a profession making buildings. They are deeply convinced architecture has a real impact on society. Their office combines the realization of commercial buildings and a small studio, focusing on topics to go beyond the commercial practice to experience the art of making architecture. The local government has commissioned the Dongziguan housing project. The purpose was to find a way to feedback the countryside. As they call it in china, to reactivate the country side, a policy implemented at the national level. The aim of Dongziguan was to create new housing to improve the tourism in the area. They relocate the inhabitants from the new touristic area into those new housing.
The interview is especially based on the analysis of the Dongziguan village affordable Housing 2016#China #contemporarychinesearchitecture #density #housing #architecture #lineplus #mengfanhao #architectureinterviews #lifestyle #collectivehousing #insideoutside #landscape #waterscape #publicspace #commons #collaborativearchitecture #context #history #materiality

