"Simplify complicated materials, back to the origin" - a guiding theme for Shanghai based @lacime_architects. Their Swan Harbor Park project in Szouh, China, made no exception to their golden rule: for the design the architects sought to bring traditional chinese aesthetics into a contemporary building. Congratulations to them for winning the ICONIC AWARDS 2020: Innovative Architecture Best of Best by @gdc_architectureandinterior.⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀
